<title>UK: Petroquimica sets $100 million eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Petroquimica sets $100 million eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CS First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PETROQUIMICA</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY   *29.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    29.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25 PCT  REOFFER    **	  SPREAD    +460-470 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		*PUT AND CALL OPTIONS ON 29.OCT.01</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX   DENOMS (K) ONE (REG S) SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25 PCT  SELL CONC  1.0 PCT</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
